---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { brand } from '../lib/brand.js';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Questions or comments? Email the Royal Nutrition team.">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Let's talk strength.</h1>
    <p class="lede">A question about a formula, an ingredient or an order? Write to us and a specialist will reply as quickly as possible.</p>

    <ul class="cards">
      <li>
        <span class="label">Office</span>
        <a href={`mailto:${brand.emails.office}`}>{brand.emails.office}</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">Product information</span>
        <a href={`mailto:${brand.emails.info}`}>{brand.emails.info}</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">Address</span>
        <address>{brand.address.map((line) => <span>{line}</span>)}</address>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">Website</span>
        <a href={brand.website}>www.royalnutrition-pro.com</a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h2 id="faq-title">Before you write</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>How do I choose the right product?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>Start from your goal. Each of the seven ranges is built around one purpose, and every product page lists the dose, ingredients and directions so you can compare with confidence.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Where do I find the full nutrition information?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>On every product page: nutrition tables per serving and per 100 g, the complete ingredient list, directions for use and everything the product is free from.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Which flavours are available?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>Flavoured products show their flavours on the product page, and you can filter the whole range by flavour in the catalogue.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I take supplements alongside medication?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>Always follow the directions on the pack and do not exceed the recommended dose. For any medical question, speak to your doctor first.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <a class="btn ghost" href="/products/">Enter the range</a>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { padding-block: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px); min-height: 56vh; }
  h1 { margin-top: 14px; max-width: 18ch; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.8vw, 62px); font-weight: 700; }
  .lede { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; max-width: 54ch; }
  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 1px; margin: 36px 0; background: var(--line); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .cards li { padding: 24px; background: var(--white); min-width: 0; }
  .label { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
  .cards a { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; text-underline-offset: 4px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  address { font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; }
  address span { display: block; }
  .faq { margin: 56px 0 40px; }
  .faq h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px); font-weight: 600; }
  .faq-list { margin-top: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .faq details { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .faq summary { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 64px; padding-right: 48px; font: 600 clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px)/1.3 var(--display); cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .plus { position: absolute; right: 8px; top: 50%; width: 16px; height: 16px; translate: 0 -50%; }
  .plus::before, .plus::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 7px; width: 16px; height: 2px; background: var(--ink); transition: rotate .3s var(--ease-out); }
  .plus::after { rotate: 90deg; }
  .faq details[open] .plus::after { rotate: 0deg; }
  .faq details p { max-width: 64ch; padding: 0 48px 24px 0; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
